{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0a1b2c3d4e5f6071",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2850,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 6000,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Multivariate data and covariance\n\nRead from data representation and sampling assumptions to population moments, sample statistics and the conditions for using ranks, distances and scales.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 多元数据与协方差\n\n先分清数据表示与抽样假设，再进入总体矩、样本统计量，以及秩、距离与尺度的使用条件。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b2c3d4e5f607182",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元数据矩阵|Multivariate data matrix]]\n\nAn $n\\times p$ table records $n$ observational units in rows and $p$ variables in columns. Entry $x_{ij}$ is variable $j$ for unit $i$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n行记录观察单位，列记录变量；矩阵形状不自带抽样假设。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1d2e3f405162738",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[数据矩阵不推出抽样模型|Data tables and sampling models]]\n\nThe same table layout can describe independent samples, repeated measurements or time series. Row structure alone establishes none of these laws.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n相同行列结构可以对应不同生成机制；独立与同分布须由抽样模型支持。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c3d4e5f60718293",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[随机向量|Random vector]]\n\nA vector records several random variables at the same outcome on one probability space. $X$ is random; $x=X(\\omega)$ is one realization.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一基本结果同时产生全部坐标；坐标数p与观测数n含义不同，联合输出不表示坐标相互独立。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2e3f40516273849",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -150,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "## [[边际分布不定联合分布]]\n\n每个分量各自服从什么分布，仍不足以知道它们怎样一起变化。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4e5f60718293a4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2750,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "## [[多元数据诊断]]\n\n依次核实观察单位、变量语义、边际、成对结构、尺度、缺失和异常来源。\n\n诊断提出调查问题，不自动授权改数据。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e5f60718293a4b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[均值向量|Mean vector]]\n\nWhen $E|X_j|<\\infty$ for each real coordinate, $\\mu=E[X]$ collects their expectations. It describes the population center.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n各坐标绝对可积时逐项取期望；不要求坐标独立，也不描述全部联合分布。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3f405162738495a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[均值向量仿射变换|Affine transformation of the mean]]\n\nFor coordinatewise integrable real $X$ and fixed compatible $A,b$, $E[AX+b]=AE[X]+b$. $A$ may be rectangular.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定矩阵和偏移可提出期望；无需独立或Gaussian。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[协方差矩阵|Covariance matrix]]\n\nFor a real random vector $X$ with $p$ coordinates, finite second moments and mean $\\mu=E[X]$, $\\Sigma=E[(X-\\mu)(X-\\mu)^T]$ is a fixed $p\\times p$ population matrix.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对角是分量方差，非对角是两两协方差；总体期望与数据估计分别处理。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f405162738495a6b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性投影方差|Variance of a linear combination]]\n\nFor a real random vector with finite second moments and fixed real weights $a$, $\\operatorname{Var}(a^TX)=a^T\\Sigma a$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定权重组合的方差来自全部两两协方差；权重不必和为一。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "05162738495a6b7c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[协方差仿射变换|Covariance under affine maps]]\n\nFor real $X$ with finite second moments and fixed $A,b$, $\\operatorname{Cov}(AX+b)=A\\Sigma A^T$. $A$ may be rectangular.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n左乘混合各行，右乘混合各列；固定平移不改变协方差。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "8293a4b5c6d7e8f9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[相关矩阵|Correlation matrix]]\n\nWith positive finite coordinate variances, $R_{jk}=\\Sigma_{jk}/(\\sigma_j\\sigma_k)$, where $\\sigma_j$ is coordinate $j$’s standard deviation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每项除以两个标准差，得到无量纲相关性；常数坐标的相关系数未定义。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "162738495a6b7c8d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "## [[相关矩阵尺度不变性]]\n\nCorr(Yⱼ,Yₖ) = sgn(bⱼbₖ) Corr(Xⱼ,Xₖ)。\n\n两斜率同号时该对相关不变，异号时翻转。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "60718293a4b5c6d7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本均值向量|Sample mean vector]]\n\nAverage across $n$ observations separately in each of $p$ coordinates: $\\bar X=n^{-1}\\sum_iX_i$. The observed result is $\\bar x$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n跨观测逐坐标平均；统计量随抽样而变，当前算出的值固定。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2738495a6b7c8d9e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": 1840,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本均值无偏性|Unbiasedness of the sample mean]]\n\nIf each observation has integrable coordinates and the same mean $\\mu$, then $E[\\bar X]=\\mu$. Independence is unnecessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n共同有限均值已经足够；无偏不表示某次估计必然等于总体值。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "38495a6b7c8d9eaf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 1840,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本均值协方差|Covariance of the sample mean]]\n\nWith finite second moments, $\\operatorname{Cov}(\\bar X)=n^{-2}\\sum_{i,k}\\operatorname{Cov}(X_i,X_k)$. Uncorrelated observations with common covariance $\\Sigma$ give $\\Sigma/n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保留全部交叉协方差；iid是常用充分条件，复制行不会增加独立信息。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "718293a4b5c6d7e8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2100,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本协方差矩阵|Sample covariance matrix]]\n\nFor complete real data with $n\\ge2$, $s=X_c^TX_c/(n-1)$, where $X_c$ subtracts each column mean. $S$ denotes the random statistic.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n中心化后汇总两两偏差乘积；总体协方差、随机统计量和实现值各有含义。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "495a6b7c8d9eaf01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2300,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本协方差无偏分母|The unbiased covariance divisor]]\n\nFor $n\\ge2$ iid observations with finite second moments and covariance $\\Sigma$, the centered sum has expectation $(n-1)\\Sigma$. Thus $E[S]=\\Sigma$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nn−1修正估计中心后的方差缩小；依赖数据须重查样本均值协方差。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a6b7c8d9eaf0123",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1750,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gaussian协方差MLE边界|Gaussian covariance MLE]]\n\nWith unknown mean and unrestricted $\\Sigma\\succ0$, centered scatter $C$ gives the unique MLE $C/n$ exactly when $C\\succ0$. Singular $C$ makes the likelihood unbounded.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n均值未知且协方差正定、不加约束时，中心化散布满秩才有有限极大值；奇异时似然无界。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5c6d7e8f9011223",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1200,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本协方差秩边界|Sample covariance rank]]\n\nFor complete real $n\\times p$ data, $n\\ge2$, $\\operatorname{rank}(s)=\\operatorname{rank}(X_c)\\le\\min(p,n-1)$. Invertibility requires full column rank of $X_c$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\np≥n必奇异；p<n仍可能有精确仿射冗余。该上界无需抽样分布假设。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "93a4b5c6d7e8f901",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[马氏距离|Mahalanobis distance]]\n\nFor a fixed real symmetric positive-definite scale $\\Sigma$, $d_\\Sigma(x,y)=\\sqrt{(x-y)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(x-y)}$. It is Euclidean distance after an invertible whitening map.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n按方向尺度衡量两点位移；平方根属于距离定义，平方距离是另一个量。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b7c8d9eaf012345",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[马氏距离不要求正态|Does distance require normality?]]\n\nPositive-definite scaling defines geometry without a probability model. A chi-square tail probability needs a separate distributional justification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n真实均值、正定协方差与联合Gaussian给出精确卡方校准；拟合参数须另行推导。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c8d9eaf01234567",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异尺度马氏伪距离|Singular-scale pseudodistance]]\n\nFor a fixed real symmetric singular positive-semidefinite scale, $\\Sigma^+$ discards nullspace directions. Distinct points can receive zero pseudodistance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n限制在保留的子空间或其固定平移上，可恢复真度量；空间外的点须另查支撑。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4b5c6d7e8f90112",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义方差|Generalized variance]]\n\nFor finite second moments, $\\det\\Sigma$ multiplies all principal-direction variances. One zero direction makes the product zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n协方差行列式概括联合散布；为零不表示其他方向没有变化。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d9eaf0123456789",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义方差与椭球体积|Covariance ellipsoid volume]]\n\nFor $\\Sigma\\succ0$ and finite $r\\ge0$, the filled region $(x-\\mu)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)\\le r^2$ has volume $\\kappa_p r^p\\sqrt{\\det\\Sigma}$, where $\\kappa_p$ is the volume of the $p$-dimensional unit ball. This geometry needs no Gaussian model.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n$r\\ge0$为半径，$\\kappa_p$为$p$维单位球体积。固定维度与半径，体积随广义方差的平方根变化；几何公式本身不要求正态。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "9eaf0123456789ab",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2630,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义方差尺度敏感性|Units and coordinate changes]]\n\nFor fixed real square $A$ and fixed $b$, $\\det\\operatorname{Cov}(AX+b)=\\det(A)^2\\det\\Sigma$. A determinant-one shear preserves this number while changing shape.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定实方阵A与固定平移b下，单位换算按平方因子进入乘积；行列式为一的剪切也保持广义方差。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0018-centering",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2950,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[中心化矩阵|Centering matrix]]\n\nFor an integer $n\\ge1$, $H=I_n-\\mathbf1_n\\mathbf1_n^T/n$ subtracts each column mean. It projects observation columns onto the sum-zero subspace and has rank $n-1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nH作用在观测轴；中心化不等于除以标准差，也不创造独立性。"
    }
  ],
