      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Fixed compatible A,b preserve affine expectations · 固定相容A,b给仿射期望"
    },
    {
      "id": "3445566778899aab",
      "fromNode": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "f405162738495a6b",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Read the variance for fixed real weights · 读取固定实权重组合的方差"
    },
    {
      "id": "45566778899aabbc",
      "fromNode": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "05162738495a6b7c",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Fixed linear maps transform both covariance indices · 固定线性映射作用于两个指标"
    },
    {
      "id": "566778899aabbccd",
      "fromNode": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "8293a4b5c6d7e8f9",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Divide by both standard deviations when they are positive · 正标准差下作双边归一化"
    },
    {
      "id": "6778899aabbccdde",
      "fromNode": "8293a4b5c6d7e8f9",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "162738495a6b7c8d",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Positive rescaling preserves correlations; sign reversal may flip them · 正缩放不变，反向缩放可能翻号"
    },
    {
      "id": "78899aabbccddeef",
      "fromNode": "1b2c3d4e5f607182",
