      "toNode": "495a6b7c8d9eaf01",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Under iid finite-second-moment sampling · iid且二阶矩有限时无偏"
    },
    {
      "id": "ddeef0123456789a",
      "fromNode": "718293a4b5c6d7e8",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "5a6b7c8d9eaf0123",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Full-rank centered scatter gives the unrestricted Gaussian MLE · 中心化散布满秩才有无约束Gaussian极大值"
    },
    {
      "id": "eef0123456789abc",
      "fromNode": "718293a4b5c6d7e8",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "b5c6d7e8f9011223",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Centering leaves at most n−1 independent directions · 中心化留下至多n−1个独立方向"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef0123456789abcd",
      "fromNode": "5f60718293a4b5c6",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "93a4b5c6d7e8f901",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Use a positive-definite covariance as the scale · 正定协方差可作为尺度"
